OL,5,G1600 All Creatures Great and Small
OL,6,     FHelen struggles when Jenny
OL,7,     Freceives exciting news, Tristan
OL,8,     Fdoubts himself when he tries to
OL,9,     Ffit in to Charlotte's world, and
OL,10,     FSiegfried has an encounter with a
OL,11,     Ftroublesome goat.
OL,12,G1700 All Creatures Great and Small
OL,13,     FJames gets into a spot of bother
OL,14,     Fwhen he takes on the role of
OL,15,     Fattending vet at Hensfield dog
OL,16,     Ftrack. Tristan attends to an
OL,17,     Faggressive parrot. Jimmy tells
