OL,5,G2330 Taggart
OL,6,     FThe Taggart team are assigned to
OL,7,     Fprotect a convicted murderer
OL,8,     Freleased after serving a life
OL,9,     Fsentence. Not long after, members
OL,10,     Fof her family begin dying under
OL,11,     Fstrange circumstances.
OL,12,G0135 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FToni gets her drug delivery, among
OL,14,     Ftins of fruit. Monica refuses
OL,15,     FToni's effort to recruit her as
OL,16,     Fmuscle, so she hires Martha. Jim
OL,17,     Fand Vera bond over a few drinks
OL,18,     Fand end up kissing.
